# ============================================================
# CELL 07B — EDITORIAL SUPPLEMENTARY MATERIAL WORKBOOKS
#
# Purpose
# -------
# Build three editorial supplementary-material workbooks from the
# canonical publication tables generated in Cell 07:
#
#   Supplementary Material 1:
#       Methods and inferential diagnostics.
#
#   Supplementary Material 2:
#       Additional results, robustness diagnostics, and the
#       supplementary-figure plan.
#
#   Supplementary Material 3:
#       Machine-readable source data for the main tables and future
#       main/supplementary figures.
#
# Every workbook contains:
#   - README
#   - CONTENTS
#   - Structured publication tables
#   - SOURCE_MANIFEST with source paths and SHA-256 hashes
#
# Delivery
# --------
# Google Colab:
#   Triggers three browser downloads. The browser controls the final
#   destination folder.
#
# Local Jupyter:
#   Copies the three files to the first available Desktop/Escritorio
#   folder.
#
# Scientific hierarchy
# --------------------
# - AE2 inference: Cell 03.
# - AE3 central effects: Cell 04.
# - Pooled RUV and decision diagnostics: Cell 05.
# - Authoritative AE3 inference: Cell 06 policy-reselection bootstrap.
# - Canonical publication tables: Cell 07.
# ============================================================

